Package: form.references
Title: Reference Data for Form Models
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R:
    person("Tony", "Chemit", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "dev@tchemit.fr")
Description: Downloads and caches reference tables required by form models.
    Verifies catalogue and data checksums before updating local files,
    preserves textual codes, and supports authenticated sources and offline use.
License: LGPL-2.1
URL: https://ultreia-io.github.io/form.references/,
    https://github.com/ultreia-io/form.references
BugReports: https://github.com/ultreia-io/form.references/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: form.model (>= 0.5.1), base64enc, curl, digest, yaml, stats, utils
Remotes: ultreia-io/form.model@v0.5.1
Suggests: askpass, knitr, rmarkdown, testthat (>= 3.0.0), withr
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/Needs/coverage: covr, xml2
Config/Needs/website: pkgdown, covr, htmltools, xml2
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
